OL,3,GNEWSAMum makes emotional plea for
OL,4,Areturn of daughter, 13, missing for six
OL,5,Adays
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe mother of a 13-year-old girl who
OL,8,Fhas been missing from home for six days
OL,9,Fhas made an emotional plea for her safe
OL,10,Freturn.
OL,12,FLillia, from Bolton, Greater
OL,13,FManchester, was last seen on Saturday
OL,14,Fat the Trafford Centre shopping mall
OL,15,Fwearing a small black backpack.
OL,17,FPolice said they believe she then
OL,18,Fboarded a bus to nearby Altrincham at
OL,19,Fabout 13:50 BST, but it is not known
OL,20,Fwhere she got off.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
